---
import ConceptLayout from "../../../layouts/ConceptLayout.astro";
---

<ConceptLayout
  concept={1}
  status="Editorial Forest · refined comp"
  title="Concept 1 — Editorial Forest (refined homepage mockup)"
  description="Refined homepage visual concept: editorial forest palette, BetterCare-quality polish, medium interaction density."
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <style>
      .c1 {
        --ink: #1a2e28;
        --muted: #3d524c;
        --surface: #f4f6f4;
        --mist: #e8f0ec;
        --white: #ffffff;
        --accent: #2d6a5a;
        --accent-bright: #3a8a72;
        --forest: #1e4d42;
        --border: #c5d5cc;
        font-family: "Source Sans 3", system-ui, sans-serif;
        font-size: 1.125rem;
        line-height: 1.65;
        color: var(--ink);
        background: var(--surface);
      }
      .c1 h1,
      .c1 h2,
      .c1 h3 {
        font-family: "Source Serif 4", Georgia, serif;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      .c1 header {
        position: sticky;
        top: 2.25rem;
        z-index: 40;
        backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      }
      .c1 .shell {
        max-width: 72rem;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0 clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 2rem);
      }
      .c1 .nav-row {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
        padding: 0.9rem 0;
      }
      .c1 .brand {
        font-family: "Source Serif 4", serif;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        line-height: 1.25;
        text-decoration: none;
        color: var(--ink);
      }
      .c1 .brand small {
        display: block;
        font-family: "Source Sans 3", sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.8125rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-weight: 400;
      }
      .c1 .nav-links {
        display: none;
        gap: 1.25rem;
        font-size: 0.9375rem;
      }
      .c1 .nav-links a {
        color: var(--muted);
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .c1 .nav-links a:hover {
        color: var(--accent);
      }
      @media (min-width: 900px) {
        .c1 .nav-links {
          display: flex;
        }
      }
      .c1 .nav-actions {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.5rem;
      }
      .c1 .langs span {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 0.3rem 0.55rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      .c1 .langs span.on {
        background: var(--forest);
        color: #fff;
        border-color: var(--forest);
      }
      .c1 .hero {
        min-height: min(calc(100dvh - 7rem), 54rem);
        display: grid;
        align-items: center;
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .c1 .hero-bg {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background: linear-gradient(118deg, #e8f0ec 0%, #b8d4c8 48%, #7aa892 100%);
      }
      .c1 .hero-bg::after {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background: linear-gradient(95deg, #f4f6f4f8 0%, #f4f6f4e0 42%, transparent 72%);
      }
      .c1 .hero-grid {
        position: relative;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
        padding: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem) 0;
        align-items: center;
      }
      @media (min-width: 920px) {
        .c1 .hero-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 1.08fr 0.92fr;
        }
      }
      .c1 .hero-copy {
        border-left: 5px solid var(--accent-bright);
        padding-left: clamp(1.15rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
      }
      .c1 .eyebrow {
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--accent);
      }
      .c1 h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5.2vw, 3.85rem);
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        line-height: 1.06;
        margin: 0.85rem 0 0;
        max-width: 15ch;
      }
      .c1 .lead {
        font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 2vw, 1.3125rem);
        line-height: 1.65;
        color: var(--muted);
        max-width: 40ch;
        margin: 1.35rem 0 0;
      }
      .c1 .hero-note {
        margin-top: 1rem;
        font-size: 1rem;
        color: #476776;
        max-width: 42ch;
      }
      .c1 .photo-slot {
        aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
        max-height: min(520px, 70vh);
        border-radius: 1.35rem;
        background: linear-gradient(165deg, #ffffffcc 0%, #ffffff66 100%);
        border: 1px solid #5a7a6e55;
        box-shadow: 0 28px 70px rgba(30, 77, 66, 0.14);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 2rem;
        color: #2f4f44;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        line-height: 1.55;
      }
      .c1 .actions {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        margin-top: 1.85rem;
      }
      .c1 .btn {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        min-height: 3.125rem;
        min-width: 8.5rem;
        padding: 0 1.5rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        text-decoration: none;
        border: 1px solid transparent;
        transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
      }
      .c1 .btn:focus-visible {
        outline: 3px solid #3a8a7288;
        outline-offset: 3px;
      }
      .c1 .btn-primary {
        background: var(--accent-bright);
        color: #fff;
      }
      .c1 .btn-secondary {
        background: #fff;
        border-color: var(--border);
        color: var(--ink);
      }
      .c1 .btn-ghost {
        background: transparent;
        border-color: var(--accent);
        color: var(--forest);
      }
      .c1 .btn:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow: 0 14px 32px rgba(26, 46, 40, 0.14);
      }
      .c1 .trust-band {
        background: #eef4f1;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      }
      .c1 .trust-inner {
        display: grid;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        padding: 1.15rem 0;
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .c1 .trust-inner {
          grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
          gap: 1rem;
        }
      }
      .c1 .trust-item {
        display: flex;
        gap: 0.65rem;
        align-items: flex-start;
        font-size: 1rem;
        line-height: 1.45;
        background: var(--white);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
      }
      .c1 .trust-item strong {
        display: block;
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--accent);
        margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
      }
      .c1 .trust-icon {
        flex: none;
        width: 2rem;
        height: 2rem;
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: var(--mist);
        color: var(--forest);
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }
      .c1 section {
        padding: clamp(3.75rem, 8vw, 6rem) 0;
      }
      .c1 .section-head {
        max-width: 40rem;
        margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
      }
      .c1 .section-head h2 {
        font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 4vw, 2.65rem);
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        margin: 0.35rem 0 0;
        line-height: 1.12;
      }
      .c1 .section-head p {
        margin: 0.85rem 0 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 1.125rem;
      }
      .c1 .cards {
        display: grid;
        gap: 1.15rem;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      @media (min-width: 720px) {
        .c1 .cards {
          grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        }
      }
      .c1 .card {
        background: var(--white);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 1rem;
        padding: 1.5rem 1.35rem 1.35rem;
        transition: transform 0.22s, border-color 0.22s, box-shadow 0.22s;
        position: relative;
      }
      .c1 .card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-3px);
        border-color: var(--accent);
        box-shadow: 0 18px 44px rgba(30, 77, 66, 0.1);
      }
      .c1 .card .step {
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--accent-bright);
      }
      .c1 .card h3 {
        margin: 0.5rem 0 0.45rem;
        font-size: 1.3rem;
      }
      .c1 .card p {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 1.05rem;
      }
      .c1 .service-card {
        display: block;
        text-decoration: none;
        color: inherit;
      }
      .c1 .service-card .arrow {
        position: absolute;
        right: 1.1rem;
        bottom: 1.1rem;
        color: var(--accent);
        font-weight: 700;
        transition: transform 0.2s;
      }
      .c1 .service-card:hover .arrow {
        transform: translateX(4px);
      }
      .c1 .faq-layout {
        display: grid;
        gap: 2.5rem;
      }
      @media (min-width: 900px) {
        .c1 .faq-layout {
          grid-template-columns: minmax(240px, 0.75fr) minmax(0, 1.25fr);
          align-items: start;
        }
        .c1 .faq-intro {
          position: sticky;
          top: 6.5rem;
        }
      }
      .c1 details {
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        padding: 0;
      }
      .c1 details:last-child {
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      }
      .c1 summary {
        cursor: pointer;
        list-style: none;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 1rem;
        padding: 1.2rem 0;
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
      }
      .c1 summary::-webkit-details-marker {
        display: none;
      }
      .c1 .plus {
        width: 2rem;
        height: 2rem;
        border-radius: 50%;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        color: var(--accent);
        flex: none;
        transition: transform 0.25s, background 0.25s, color 0.25s;
      }
      .c1 details[open] .plus {
        transform: rotate(45deg);
        background: var(--accent);
        color: #fff;
        border-color: var(--accent);
      }
      .c1 details p {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0 3rem 1.25rem 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 1.05rem;
      }
      .c1 .enquiry-band {
        background: var(--forest);
        color: #fff;
      }
      .c1 .enquiry-band h2 {
        color: #fff;
        font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.35rem);
        margin: 0;
      }
      .c1 .enquiry-band p {
        color: #d4ebe4;
        max-width: 42ch;
        margin: 1rem 0 0;
      }
      .c1 .enquiry-band .btn-primary {
        background: var(--accent-bright);
        margin-top: 1.5rem;
      }
      .c1 .notice {
        background: #faf3e0;
        border: 1px solid #e8d9a8;
        border-radius: 0.75rem;
        padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
        font-size: 0.9375rem;
        line-height: 1.5;
        margin-top: 1rem;
        max-width: 48ch;
      }
      .c1 .reviews-empty {
        border: 2px dashed var(--border);
        border-radius: 1rem;
        padding: 2.25rem 1.5rem;
        text-align: center;
        color: var(--muted);
        background: #fff;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
      }
      .c1 .sticky-call {
        display: none;
      }
      @media (max-width: 639px) {
        .c1 .sticky-call {
          display: grid;
          grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
          position: fixed;
          bottom: 0;
          left: 0;
          right: 0;
          z-index: 45;
          background: var(--white);
          border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
          box-shadow: 0 -8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        }
        .c1 .sticky-call a {
          text-align: center;
          padding: 0.9rem 0.5rem;
          font-weight: 700;
          text-decoration: none;
          font-size: 0.95rem;
        }
        .c1 .sticky-call a:first-child {
          background: var(--forest);
          color: #fff;
        }
        .c1 .sticky-call a:last-child {
          color: var(--forest);
        }
        .c1 {
          padding-bottom: 3.25rem;
        }
      }
      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        .c1 .btn,
        .c1 .card,
        .c1 .plus {
          transition: none;
        }
        .c1 .btn:hover,
        .c1 .card:hover {
          transform: none;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </Fragment>

  <div class="c1" id="main">
    <header>
      <div class="shell nav-row">
        <a class="brand" href="/concepts/1/">
          Jackson · Mobile Physio
          <small>Melbourne eastern suburbs</small>
        </a>
        <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Primary (mock)">
          <a href="#services">Services</a>
          <a href="#how">How it works</a>
          <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
        </nav>
        <div class="nav-actions">
          <div class="langs" aria-label="Languages">
            <span class="on">EN</span><span>粵</span><span>普</span>
          </div>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#contact" style="min-width: auto; min-height: 2.75rem; font-size: 0.9rem; padding: 0 1rem;">Enquire</a>
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="tel:+61433479703" style="min-width: auto; min-height: 2.75rem; font-size: 0.9rem; padding: 0 1rem;">0433 479 703</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="shell hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">Independent mobile physiotherapy</p>
          <h1>Mobile physiotherapy in Melbourne&rsquo;s eastern suburbs</h1>
          <p class="lead">
            You speak with Jackson — the physiotherapist who visits you at home. Care in English, Cantonese, and Mandarin.
          </p>
          <p class="hero-note">Personal, local, and direct — not a call centre or rotating roster.</p>
          <div class="actions">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="tel:+61433479703">Call 0433 479 703</a>
            <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#contact">Send an enquiry</a>
          </div>
          <p class="notice">AHPRA physiotherapy registration is pending. This mockup does not claim current registration.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="photo-slot" role="img" aria-label="Photography placeholder">
          <div>
            <strong>Portrait &amp; home-visit photography</strong><br />
            Reserved for Jackson&rsquo;s real shoot.<br />
            No stock or AI practitioner imagery.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="trust-band">
      <div class="shell trust-inner">
        <div class="trust-item">
          <span class="trust-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
          <div>
            <strong>NDIS</strong>
            Plan-managed &amp; self-managed enquiries welcome — not an NDIS registered provider.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-item">
          <span class="trust-icon" aria-hidden="true">◎</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Service area</strong>
            Box Hill, Doncaster, Ringwood, Glen Waverley &amp; surrounding eastern suburbs.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-item">
          <span class="trust-icon" aria-hidden="true">☎</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Direct contact</strong>
            The person you call is the physiotherapist who attends your visit.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section id="services" style="background: var(--white);">
      <div class="shell">
        <div class="section-head">
          <p class="eyebrow">What we help with</p>
          <h2>Physiotherapy that fits your home and routine</h2>
          <p>Examples discussed at assessment — individual care, not a fixed programme.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cards">
          <a class="card service-card" href="#contact">
            <h3>Mobility &amp; balance</h3>
            <p>Move with more confidence at home and in your community.</p>
            <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
          <a class="card service-card" href="#contact">
            <h3>Strength &amp; function</h3>
            <p>Practical exercise aligned with everyday tasks that matter to you.</p>
            <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
          <a class="card service-card" href="#contact">
            <h3>NDIS support</h3>
            <p>Plan-managed and self-managed participants — eligibility confirmed before care.</p>
            <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="how" style="background: var(--mist);">
      <div class="shell">
        <div class="section-head">
          <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
          <h2>A clear start, with room to adapt</h2>
          <p>Three steps — same clinician from first contact.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cards">
          <article class="card">
            <span class="step">Step 1</span>
            <h3>Get in touch</h3>
            <p>Call or enquire with your suburb and how we can help.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <span class="step">Step 2</span>
            <h3>Home visit</h3>
            <p>Assessment in your environment — goals discussed with you and supports.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <span class="step">Step 3</span>
            <h3>Your plan</h3>
            <p>Ongoing physiotherapy agreed together; scope and frequency tailored to you.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="faq">
      <div class="shell faq-layout">
        <div class="faq-intro section-head" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
          <p class="eyebrow">FAQ</p>
          <h2>Questions families and referrers often ask</h2>
          <p>Every situation is different — this is a starting point, not clinical advice.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <details>
            <summary>Who will I speak with? <span class="plus">+</span></summary>
            <p>Jackson — the physiotherapist who would attend your home visit.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Are you an NDIS registered provider? <span class="plus">+</span></summary>
            <p>No. Enquiries welcome from plan-managed and self-managed participants only.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Do I need a referral? <span class="plus">+</span></summary>
            <p>Many people enquire directly. Referrers are welcome — we confirm fit before care begins.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="enquiry-band" id="contact">
      <div class="shell">
        <h2>Tell us your suburb and how we can help</h2>
        <p>A short message is enough. Full enquiry form on the production contact page.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="tel:+61433479703">Call Jackson · 0433 479 703</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="background: var(--surface); padding-top: 3rem; padding-bottom: 3rem;">
      <div class="shell">
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 0 0 1rem;">Reviews</h2>
        <div class="reviews-empty">No reviews shown until real Google feedback exists after launch.</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="sticky-call">
      <a href="tel:+61433479703">Call</a>
      <a href="#contact">Enquire</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</ConceptLayout>
